flowchart LR
    U[User Request]

    subgraph UA[UnityAgent]
        P[Policy]
        R[Routing]
        TC[Task Contract]
        C[Context Materialization]
        DR{Design Review Required?}
        DP[Design Preview\nDiagram + Checklist + Final Image Spec]
        HG{Human Approval}
        I[Investigation]
        M[Implementation]
        V[Validation]
        PE[Persistence / Evidence]
        E[Eval]
        O[Operations]
        D[User Report]
    end

    subgraph EXT[External Execution Surface]
        MCP[MyUnityMCP / Tools]
        UP[Unity Project]
    end

    U --> P --> R --> TC --> C --> DR
    DR -->|required / selected conditional| DP --> HG
    HG -->|revise| DP
    HG -->|reject| D
    HG -->|approve investigate| I
    HG -->|approve implement| M
    DR -->|not required| I
    DR -->|not required| M

    I -->|evidence changes design| DP
    I -->|implementation ready| M
    M --> MCP --> UP
    M --> V
    UP --> V
    V --> PE --> E --> D
    O -. observes / controls .-> I
    O -. observes / controls .-> M
    O -. observes / controls .-> V
    E -. regression signal .-> O
